  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To believe is to create</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In marginalized communities of northeast Medelln, young people have few social, employment, and leadership opportunities to support themselves and their families. Corporacin Proyectarte (Proyectarte) partners with local schools, social service organizations, and grassroots groups to boost young people&apos;s leadership skills and build networks to advance opportunities. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security in Colombia. Proyectarte&apos;s activities strengthen grassroots organizations through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks.</narrative>
  </description>
